
 ReSpeaker Core v2 - Debian GNU/Linux

   Wi-Fi:          nmtui
   Microphones:    arecord -c 8 -r 16000 -f S16_LE mics.wav
   Speaker/jack:   aplay file.wav        (volume: alsamixer, "Speaker")
   LED ring:       12 APA102 on /dev/spidev0.1, powered by GPIO line LED_PWR_N (active low)
   Install to eMMC (when booted from SD): sudo respeaker-install-emmc

